<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GE said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GE said upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs upgraded General Electric Co to the firm's recommended list from market outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 90-3/8 Thursday.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
